</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>One word, to show how weak am I</l><l>When in my strength alone I try,</l><l>In vain I toil, in vain I sigh;</l><l>One word, O Lord! one word from Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>One word, to show how near Thou art,</l><l>For Thou dost dwell within my heart;</l><l>And of Thy life I share a part;</l><l>One word, O Lord! one word from Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One word of power, oh, let me hear,</l><l>Above the heart’s most anxious fear,</l><l>Thy still, small voice, yet deep and clear;</l><l>One word, O Lord! one word from Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>One word of final triumph, Lord;</l><l>Sweet hope Thy promises afford,</l><l>To dwell with Thee in sweet accord;</l><l>One word, O Lord! one word from Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
